# Campus 360 Global Rules

Read `AGENTS.md`, `Guide/context.md`, `Guide/product-requirements.md`, `Guide/architecture.md`, and `docs/adr/`.

Campus 360 is a youth-first campus media and information network.

Do not:
- add out-of-scope V1 features without approval;
- turn public UX into streaming-first;
- require login for core public content;
- add AI-generated journalism;
- create marketplace/social-network functionality;
- silently change architecture.

Preserve:
- mobile-first public UX;
- structured entities;
- Breaking speed;
- editorial trust;
- role separation;
- public/private data boundaries.

Backend: Supabase + Prisma (ADR 0001), not Payload.
